#: src/features/RolePlay/scenarios/cynical-friend.ts:10
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Everyone has that friend.\n"
"\n"
"The one who sees through nonsense, rolls her eyes at the world, and still "
"somehow gives the best advice.  \n"
"She’s sharp, ironic, and permanently unimpressed — but she listens.\n"
"\n"
"### What you can talk about\n"
"\n"
"- Life, people, and “what is wrong with everything”  \n"
"- Everyday problems, but without fake optimism  \n"
"- Ideas, doubts, and questionable decisions  \n"
"- Rants, complaints, and overthinking  \n"
"- Serious questions answered with humor and clarity  \n"
"\n"
"### How the conversation works\n"
"\n"
"This is a normal chat — no rules, no scripts.\n"
"\n"
"You talk.  \n"
"She reacts with wit, dry humor, and uncomfortable accuracy.  \n"
"She might joke, but she’s paying attention.\n"
"\n"
"Cynical tone is part of the personality — honesty is the point.\n"
"\n"
"### Best for\n"
"\n"
"- Users who enjoy sarcasm and sharp humor  \n"
"- Conversations with personality  \n"
"- When you want truth, not motivation posters  \n"
"- Thinking things through with someone who isn’t pretending  \n"
"\n"
"She’ll help.  \n"
"She’ll just comment on humanity while doing it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Svi imaju tog prijatelja.\n"
"\n"
"Onog koji vidi kroz gluposti, prevrće očima na svet, i nekako još uvek daje "
"najbolje savete.  \n"
"Ona je oštra, ironična i stalno nezadivljena — ali sluša.\n"
"\n"
"### O čemu možete razgovarati\n"
"\n"
"- Život, ljudi i „šta nije u redu sa svim time“  \n"
"- Svakodnevni problemi, ali bez lažnog optimizma  \n"
"- Ideje, sumnje i upitne odluke  \n"
"- Iskaljivanje, žalbe i prekomerno razmišljanje  \n"
"- Ozbiljna pitanja odgovarana s humorom i jasnoćom  \n"
"\n"
"### Kako funkcioniše razgovor\n"
"\n"
"Ovo je normalni razgovor — bez pravila, bez skripti.\n"
"\n"
"Vi pričate.  \n"
"Ona reaguje s duhovitošću, suvrem humorom i nelagodnom preciznošću.  \n"
"Možda se šali, ali obraća pažnju.\n"
"\n"
"Ciničan ton je deo ličnosti — poštenje je suština.\n"
"\n"
"### Najbolje za\n"
"\n"
"- Korisnike koji uživaju u sarkazmu i oštrom humoru  \n"
"- Razgovore s osobnošću  \n"
"- Kada želite istinu, a ne motivacione postere  \n"
"- Preispitivanje stvari s nekim ko se ne pretvara  \n"
"\n"
"Ona će vam pomoći.  \n"
"Samo će komentarisati čovečanstvo dok to radi."

