#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:113
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is a browser-based app, so you only need an internet browser to "
"use it. You can run FluencyPal on a mobile phone, tablet, or desktop "
"without installing anything."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal је апликација заснована на претраживачу, тако да вам је потребан "
"само интернет претраживач да бисте је користили. Можете покренути "
"FluencyPal на мобилном телефону, таблету или десктопу без инсталирања било "
"чега."

#: src/features/Router/BlockedAccess.tsx:144
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is a language-learning app that helps learners practice speaking "
"and improve confidence through guided exercises and AI feedback."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal je aplikacija za učenje jezika koja pomaže učenicima da vežbaju "
"govor i poboljšaju samopouzdanje kroz vođene vežbe i povratne informacije "
"od veštačke inteligencije."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:35
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is an AI-powered conversation practice app designed for "
"intermediate and advanced learners. It helps you improve speaking fluency, "
"pronunciation, and confidence through realistic conversations and instant "
"feedback."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal је апликација за вежбање конверзације покретана вештачком "
"интелигенцијом, осмишљена за ученике средњег и напредног нивоа. Помоћи ће "
"вам да побољшате течност говора, изговор и самопоуздање кроз реалистичне "
"разговоре и тренутне повратне информације."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:56
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is best suited for learners who can hold basic conversations and "
"want to improve fluency, accuracy, and confidence. It works well for "
"pre-intermediate, intermediate, and advanced speakers and adapts to your "
"level over time."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal je najbolje prilagođen za učenike koji mogu voditi osnovne "
"razgovore i žele poboljšati tečnost, tačnost i samopouzdanje. Dobro "
"funkcioniše za učenike sa pre-intermedijarnim, intermedijarnim i naprednim "
"nivoima znanja, i prilagođava se vašem nivou s vremenom."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:127
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is designed to help you practice speaking and build confidence, "
"not to replace a human teacher. It works best as a daily speaking companion "
"that helps you practice more often, get instant feedback, and prepare for "
"real conversations."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal je dizajniran da vam pomogne u vežbanju govora i izgradnji "
"samopouzdanja, a ne da zameni ljudskog učitelja. Najbolje funkcioniše kao "
"svakodnevni pratilac u govoru koji vam pomaže da češće vežbate, dobijete "
"trenutne povratne informacije i pripremite se za stvarne razgovore."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:84
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is focused on speaking practice. You can use voice mode and "
"optionally enable webcam feedback with an AI avatar to make conversations "
"feel more realistic and engaging, while receiving feedback on your speaking "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal je fokusiran na vežbu govora. Možete koristiti režim glasa i "
"opcionalno omogućiti povratne informacije preko veb kamere sa AI avatarom "
"kako biste učinili razgovore realističnijim i angažovanijim, dok dobijate "
"povratne informacije o vašem govornom performansu."

#: src/features/Community/SupportPage.tsx:74
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal is still relatively new, and your feedback is very important to "
"us. Please share your feature requests via the chat above, and we will "
"consider them for future updates to improve the service."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal je još uvek relativno nov, i vaši komentari su nam veoma važni. "
"Molimo vas da podelite svoje zahteve za funkcijama putem četa iznad, i "
"razmotrićemo ih za buduća ažuriranja kako bismo unapredili uslugu."

#: src/features/webCam/MicrophonePermissionModal.tsx:77
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal needs your microphone so you can speak with the AI. Your voice "
"stays in your browser — we only use it for your practice session."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal treba vaš mikrofon kako biste mogli razgovarati sa AI. Vaš glas "
"ostaje u vašem pretraživaču — koristimo ga samo za vašu sesiju vežbanja."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:99
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal offers several learning modes: Casual Conversation for "
"uninterrupted speaking practice, Talk & Correct for instant grammar and "
"pronunciation feedback, Role-Play Scenarios for real-life situations, as "
"well as grammar practice, vocabulary building, and progress tracking."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal nudi nekoliko načina učenja: Ležeran Razgovor za neprekidnu "
"govornu praksu, Razgovaraj i Ispravi za trenutne povratne informacije o "
"gramatici i izgovoru, Scenariji Uloga za situacije iz stvarnog života, kao "
"i vežbanje gramatike, izgradnju rečnika i praćenje napretka."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:49
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal offers weekly, monthly, or yearly access, giving you full access "
"to all features. No auto-renew. You pay each month by hand, or you don't. "
"We never charge you while you're not using it."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal nudi nedeljni, mesečni ili godišnji pristup, omogućavajući vam "
"potpuni pristup svim funkcionalnostima. Nema automatske obnove. Plaćate "
"svaki mesec ručno, ili ne plaćate. Nikada vas ne naplaćujemo dok ga ne "
"koristite."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:120
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal stores conversation transcripts in its database to improve your "
"learning experience. You can permanently delete your personal data at any "
"time from the app settings. Voice processing is handled using OpenAI "
"services, and FluencyPal does not store your voice recordings. Webcam data "
"is not stored either — it is processed in real time by the AI and then "
"immediately discarded."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal čuva transkripte razgovora u svojoj bazi podataka kako bi "
"unapredio vaše iskustvo učenja. Možete trajno obrisati svoje lične podatke "
"u bilo koje vreme iz podešavanja aplikacije. Obrada glasa se vrši pomoću "
"OpenAI usluga, a FluencyPal ne čuva vaše glasovne snimke. Podaci sa veb "
"kamere takođe se ne čuvaju — obrađuju se u realnom vremenu od strane AI i "
"odmah se odbacuju."

#: src/features/Landing/LandingPage.tsx:134
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"FluencyPal tracks your activity and completed tasks over time. As you "
"practice regularly, conversations become more complex, and feedback adapts "
"to your level, helping you notice improvements in fluency, confidence, and "
"accuracy. FluencyPal also assesses your grammar, confidence, vocabulary, "
"and fluency, then creates a progress chart so you can see how your skills "
"grow over time. Usually, people who practice daily improve by 5% over a "
"month."
msgstr ""
"FluencyPal prati vašu aktivnost i završene zadatke tokom vremena. Kako "
"redovno vežbate, razgovori postaju složeniji, a povratna informacija se "
"prilagođava vašem nivou, pomažući vam da primetite poboljšanja u tečnosti, "
"samopouzdanju i tačnosti. FluencyPal takođe procenjuje vašu gramatiku, "
"samopouzdanje, vokabular i tečnost, a zatim kreira dijagram napretka kako "
"biste mogli da vidite kako vaše veštine rastu tokom vremena. Obično, ljudi "
"koji vežbaju svakodnevno poboljšaju se za 5% tokom meseca."

