msgid ""
"margin: auto only centers horizontally, not vertically. For a junior "
"frontend role, you should know modern solutions: Flexbox (display: flex; "
"justify-content: center; align-items: center on the parent), CSS Grid "
"(place-items: center), or absolute positioning with transform (position: "
"absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%)). Explain "
"which method you'd prefer and why—this shows you understand trade-offs and "
"current best practices."
msgstr ""
"margin: auto centrira samo horizontalno, ne vertikalno. Za junior frontend "
"poziciju, trebalo bi da znate savremena rešenja: Flexbox (display: flex; "
"justify-content: center; align-items: center na roditelju), CSS Grid "
"(place-items: center), ili apsolutno pozicioniranje sa transformacijom "
"(position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, "
"-50%)). Objasnite koju metodu biste preferirali i zašto—ovo pokazuje da "
"razumete kompromise i trenutne najbolje prakse."

